<Layout title="Why Your Attribution Model is Looking in the Wrong Direction | PresciaIQ Insights"
  description="Attribution tells you what happened. Prediction tells you what to do next. Why marketing teams need both to scale efficiently.">
  <div class="pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
